{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Bali is rich in culture and one of them is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"patung","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" (English: statue). Arca provides comprehensive statue information spread throughout Bali, allowing you to explore the way you want - super simple and convenient!","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discover Bali’s cultural heritage through an interactive, audio-guided experience that brings the stories of ancient statues to life. Whether you’re a tourist exploring for the first time or a local wanting to learn more about your cultural heritage, Arca makes statue discovery accessible and engaging."}]},{"text":"Key Features","anchor":"Key-Features","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Self-Guided Audio Tour","anchor":"Self-Guided-Audio-Tour","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arca provides an interactive audio-based tour guide for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patung"}]},{"type":"text","text":" nearby. With just one click, tour mode is activated for you. The audio tour even works while you listen to music - Arca speaks the information about the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"patung","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" you pass on the road."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"text":"Detailed Patung Information","anchor":"Detailed-Patung-Information","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Curious about the story and history behind a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patung"}]},{"type":"text","text":"? Arca provides comprehensive statue information including:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{